    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112693" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῡσιγγόομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦσιγξ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be excited by eating garlic,</i> prop. of
			fighting cocks, hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδύναις
				πεφυσιγγωμένοι</span>
			<i>infuriated</i> by vexations, of the Megarians (who were large
			growers of garlic), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				526
			</span></i>.</div>
